<title>USA: Supervalu expands freezer capacity.</title>
<headline>Supervalu expands freezer capacity.</headline>
<dateline>PLEASANT PRAIRIE, Wis. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Supervalu Inc said Wednesday it completed a 16,000-square-foot expansion of its freezer capacity in Pleasant Prairie, Wis.</p>
<p>It also said it completed a 16,000-square-foot addition to accommodate the company's Midwest regional marketing office.</p>
<p>The food distribution and retailing company said it is on target to add 125 jobs it estimated would result from locating its regional office in the Kenosha, Wis. suburb. Total employment at the facility is about 550.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
